g boleh muncul pada base yang dipilih","Item kind":"Jenis item","Shields only":"Perisai sahaja","Foci only":"Fokus sahaja","Quivers only":"Sarung panah sahaja","Shields, foci & quivers":"Perisai, fokus & sarung panah","Only reds on the picked bases":"Hanya merah pada base yang dipilih","Import this build?":"Import build ini?","The rules highlight the lines on the gear of this build. With the hide switch on, other Normal, Magic and Rare gear is hidden too. Nothing changes until you choose.":"Peraturan menyerlahkan baris pada kelengkapan build ini. Apabila suis sembunyi dihidupkan, kelengkapan Normal, Magic dan Rare yang lain turut disembunyikan. Tiada apa berubah sehingga anda memilih.","Gear pieces":"Bahagian kelengkapan","Strictness":"Ketegasan","Hide everything else (like the Easy Mode preset)":"Sembunyikan semua yang lain (seperti pratetap mod Easy)","Endgame: one rule set at Rupture Level 75, tiers capped to the best 2 that drop there.":"Endgame: satu set peraturan pada Rupture Level 75, tier dihadkan kepada 2 yang terbaik yang jatuh di situ.","Uber Strict: item level 82+ only, best tier only; the core rule needs a top roll.":"Uber Strict: hanya item level 82+, hanya tier terbaik; peraturan teras memerlukan top roll.","Leveling: the tier cap opens up step by step with the item level (T8 down to the build's tier).":"Leveling: had tier terbuka sedikit demi sedikit mengikut item level (dari T8 hingga tier build).","The build wears no gear.":"Build tidak memakai kelengkapan.","The build has no gear lines or uniques to highlight.":"Build tiada baris kelengkapan atau unique untuk diserlahkan."}}